# Privacy Policy

**Last updated: September 19, 2026**

This Privacy Policy explains how KOULA ("we", "us", or "our") collects, uses, and protects personal data when you use the KOULA mobile application and related services.

By using KOULA, you agree to the processing of your information as described in this Privacy Policy.

## 1. Information We Collect

Depending on how you use KOULA, we may collect the following information:

### Contact Information

* Name
* Email address
* Phone number
* Physical address

### Financial Information

* Payment information

### Location Information

* Precise location
* Approximate/coarse location

Location information may be used to provide services based on your location and to improve the functionality of KOULA.

### User Content

* Photos and videos
* Other content submitted by users
* Emails or text messages sent through the service

### Identifiers

* User ID

### Purchases

* Purchase history and information about transactions made through KOULA

### Usage Data

* Product interaction
* Other usage data

### Diagnostics

* Crash data
* Performance data
* Other diagnostic information

## 2. How We Use Your Information

We may use the information we collect for the following purposes:

### Providing and Operating KOULA

We use information to:

* Create and manage user accounts
* Allow users to create and book services
* Process purchases and payments
* Facilitate communication between users
* Provide location-based functionality
* Process and manage transactions
* Provide customer support
* Maintain and improve the application

### Analytics and Improvement

We may use certain information, such as name, physical address, coarse location, usage data, crash data, and performance data, to understand how KOULA is used, identify problems, and improve the service.

### Security and Fraud Prevention

Information may also be processed when necessary to protect KOULA, its users, and transactions from fraud, abuse, unauthorized access, or other security threats.

## 3. Payments

Payments made through KOULA may be processed by third-party payment service providers.

Payment providers may collect and process payment information according to their own privacy policies. KOULA does not necessarily store complete payment card information on its own systems.

## 4. Location Information

KOULA may request access to your precise or approximate location.

Location information may be used to:

* Show services available near you
* Help users find suitable service providers
* Enable location-based features
* Improve the functionality of the application

You can control location permissions through your device settings. Disabling location access may prevent certain KOULA features from working correctly.

## 5. Photos and User Content

Users may voluntarily upload photos, videos, messages, descriptions, or other content to KOULA.

This content may be processed and displayed to other users when necessary to provide KOULA's services.

You should not upload sensitive personal information or content that you do not have the right to share.

## 6. Data Sharing

We may share information with service providers that help us operate KOULA, such as:

* Payment processors
* Cloud hosting providers
* Analytics and diagnostic providers
* Communication and notification providers
* Other technical service providers necessary to operate the application

We do not sell your personal information.

We may also disclose information when required by law, legal process, or to protect the rights, safety, and security of KOULA, our users, or others.

## 7. Data Retention

We retain personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary to provide our services, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, enforce agreements, and maintain appropriate business records.

When information is no longer necessary, it may be deleted or anonymized.

## 8. Your Rights

Depending on applicable law, including the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), you may have the right to:

* Request access to your personal data
* Request correction of inaccurate information
* Request deletion of your personal data
* Request restriction of processing
* Object to certain processing
* Request data portability
* Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent

To exercise your rights, contact us using the contact information below.

## 9. Children's Privacy

KOULA is not intended to knowingly collect personal information from children in violation of applicable law.

If you believe that a child has provided personal information to us without appropriate authorization, please contact us so that we can review and take appropriate action.

## 10. Data Security

We use reasonable technical and organizational measures designed to protect personal information against unauthorized access, loss, misuse, alteration, or disclosure.

However, no internet transmission or electronic storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.

## 11. Third-Party Services

KOULA may use third-party services for functionality, payments, analytics, hosting, diagnostics, notifications, and other technical purposes.

These providers may process information according to their own privacy policies and applicable laws.

## 12. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.

When we make significant changes, we may provide additional notice through the application or other appropriate means.

The "Last updated" date at the top of this Privacy Policy indicates when the policy was most recently updated.

